        "# Generator iterator\n",
        "\n",
        "A generator iterator is the object returned by a generator function. It supports iteration as well as generator operations such as `send()`, `throw()`, and `close()`.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-generator-iterator)"
      ]
    }
